{"id":"char_2013_cerber","recs":[{"name":"XXL Honey Biscuit","tag":"Children of the barrens will apply nature's norms in civilized society.","unlock":[{"t":"AWAKE","p":["2","1"]},{"t":"FAVOR","p":["50"]}],"lines":[{"x":"Rhodes Island Landship"},{"x":"Vulcan's Workshop"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Kay."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What is it, Vulcan  ?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Need my help?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"When was the last time you performed maintenance on your equipment?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Well..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Let me think."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"One... Two..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ceobe counts on her fingers)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Fifteen days, I think?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"It's about time. You'd better get to work on them."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You still have that maintenance diagram I drew for you?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yup! I hung it up in my room."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Are there sufficient tools and consumables in that room? If you've run out, you can take some now."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"There's enough!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Good."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Let's clean up and pack up. Then we can head out when the fire dies down."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Leave? Are you going out?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Yes, I have to go check on the boiler room, then collect the materials I ordered from the warehouse  . Don't have time to worry about the fire."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I can watch the fire."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"That's not a good job   for you."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You have things you need to do as well, right?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I guess."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Almost time. Let's go."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I made you a lunch, remember to take it when you leave."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'll come find you when I finish."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, Vulcan  ."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Right, see you later."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Come back soon!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh... She's gone..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What... should I do...?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'll go to my room to take care of my babies   then."},{"x":"Dormitories"},{"x":"Ceobe's Room"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"This...  The picture   says vegetable oil."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vegetable oil?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Is it... this?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"The label says——Vege... table... Oil...!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I got it!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What's the next step?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Dip the cloth into the oil, then slowly rub all the shiny parts."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yup, just like that!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I remember it super clearly."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hehe."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I wonder what Vulcan will say when she sees how good   I did? Maybe I'll get a gift?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"She made a top   for me last time. It's so fun to spin!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Maybe I'll get something even better this time."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I've never tasted oil before."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Since it's food for my babies, it must taste good."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ceobe dips her finger in the oil and licks it)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Blech."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Looks like I can't eat the food my babies like."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"And here I thought maybe we'd have something to enjoy together."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmph."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Back to work."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, I'm done!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What to do next?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh, I have to wipe oil on other parts."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"With different oils too."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yeah."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"......"},{"x":"A long, long time later..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I think I'm almost done."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'm kinda hungry."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, lunch time, lunch time."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Today's lunch is——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Grilled meatbeast chop! And mashed potatoes with sauce!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Awawawa!!!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah——finished!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan is so good at crafting anything, even food!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"But——I'm still a little hungry——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hm, what time is it now?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh, eleven... eleven fifteen... It's noon!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"It's time for everyone to eat!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Which means——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yay!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Away!!!"},{"x":"11:30 A.M."},{"x":"Rhodes Island Cafeteria"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow, there's a lot of people here!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Let's see what food they have."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"W-Wow!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow!!"},{"n":"Courier","x":"Hello, Ceobe. What do you want to eat?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'm looking."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Since there's so much good food here, there must be more inside!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Okay, let me think how to sneak inside.)"},{"n":"Courier","x":"Are you going to order?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"No, I don't need to  ."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Bye!"},{"n":"Courier","x":"See you."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Courier, the food for your counter is almost here. Be ready."},{"n":"Courier","x":"Okay."},{"n":"Courier","x":"(Whisper) She's here."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"(Whisper) Understood."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan taught me to watch closely and wait for a chance."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I didn't watch enough last time and the old guy caught me at the door..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"But this time will be different!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'll definitely get inside!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Mmm——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"......"},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Shchi, huh? If I recall correctly, it goes there in the middle, where Courier is standing."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Alright."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(The door is close to my hiding spot.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(There's a pretty lady by the door, I can't let her see me.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Little Cub is talking to her.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(There's a lot of tasty stuff next to her, but people are watching.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(There's a little hole further away. I think it is for dishes. I can't get through it.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(The door is my only choice.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(But the door's so crowded still.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Hmm, I'll wait   a while more.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Okay the door is quieter now.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(No one's there!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Now's my chance!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Go!!!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yummy goodies, here I come!"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Wooaahh! Kay, you can't go in there!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I can't?"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"You can't! Don't you see the sign on the door?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I see it."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I see a red circle with a tilty red line going through it."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I also see Kay."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"That means 'Kay is not allowed in here.' Got it?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"If you get it, why are you still going in?!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hungry."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"If you're hungry, you can just get in line and order something to eat."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hungry."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Y-You're not allowed in there!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"But I'm hungry!"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Fine, fine! I'll think of something!!"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"What if I..."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"If I give you this cookie, will you promise not to go inside?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"*sniff* *sniff*"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Mm!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, okay!"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Here..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Thanks!"},{"x":"Not long afterwards..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Little Cub's cookie was tasty."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"But I'm still hungry..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Sorry Little Cub, I still want to go in."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Maybe I got found out because I was too excited."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I won't make the same mistake again!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hm, let's see..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"......"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(The only one by the door is the pretty lady at the counter.)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(The door is still open?!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Wow!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(There's bread in that basket!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Smells so fresh!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(I wanna eat it!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yummy yummy goodies, here I come!!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"What is it? Where are you going?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Oh no, I got caught!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Urk... Ahhh..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(What do I do?! What do I do?!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I-I want to go to the toilet."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"This isn't the toilet. There's a sign over there, look for the one with the blue and pink people."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh, I see!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Thanks, pretty lady!"},{"n":"Gitano","x":"No problem, don't make the same mistake next time."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ahh, I'm lucky she didn't figure me out. I don't want Vulcan to get mad at me.)"},{"n":"Gitano","x":"......"},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Gitano, the last dish is here."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Ah, good job. This should go to the farthest corner where Noir Corne is."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Alright..."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"What's up?"},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Nothing really, Gummy bit me."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Ooh, I didn't know you two were THAT close."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Don't joke about it, it hurts."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Hm-hmm."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Oh, right."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Huh?"},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Put two standard meal sets at the prep station near the kitchen door."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"To feed the Perro?"},{"n":"Gitano","x":"I'm good."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Sure, I'll tell the cooks."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"O-Owww..."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Maybe it'll go numb later?"},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Please no. Spare me..."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"I'm just joking~"},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"If you're joking, doesn't that mean I'm done for..."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Of course not."},{"n":"Gitano","x":"Go on, we can wrap up and have lunch soon."},{"n":"Dur-nar","x":"Okay..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'll make it this time!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Let's see."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"......"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"There's no one there at all."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Even the pretty lady by the door is gone."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yay!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hah!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hehe, the door is unlocked."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I'm going in!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ohh! There really was food here!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"How is the taste——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow, it's tasty!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"So good!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Awawa."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah, I'm so happy I got to eat!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I better go home and finish taking care of my babies!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Just now, wasn't Little Cub's tummy rumbling?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Is she hungry because she gave her cookie to me?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Poor Little Cub..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan says that when people help you, you should pay it back double or triple or whatever's even more than those, I forgot! Fourple?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Anyway, Little Cub gave me a small cookie, so I should give her a really really really——big cookie."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, I'll make it as soon as Vulcan gets back!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Now I need to go home and finish up my work."},{"x":"Ceobe's Room"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hmm..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Weapons are done."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"The covers for the weapons and the bag are clean."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Just one last thing left."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan, please hurry back, so Little Cub won't be hungry anymore..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Who's there?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"It's me."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah, Vulcan! I'll get the door!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"You came back really early today."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Work went nice and smooth today, finished quick."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Can you let me see your maintenance work?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay, okay!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I just finished, the weapons are all neat on the table!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Great, I'll have a look."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"......"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(I did it just like the pictures  .)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(I have to believe in myself!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(I know I did it right!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"H-How is it?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"The oil is applied very evenly."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"(Vulcan lifts the weapon and sniffs it)"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"The right oils, too."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Oh?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You cleaned the sheaths?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yup!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Good."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You did a good job."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Thanks, Vulcan!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ehehe."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'm going back to the workshop. Do you want to come along?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Mm!"},{"x":"Vulcan's Workshop"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"This is a good batch of material here."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Hope I can make something satisfying out of it."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Go on, say it, say it! Little Cub is still starving!)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(B-But, I'm a little nervous...)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"......"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"What's wrong? Is there anything you want to tell me?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh, umm, well..."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Yes."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Can you teach me how to make a big cookie?!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Oh? You want to make your own food, finally?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Y-Yeah!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Please, teach me quickly! Little Cub is gonna starve to death soon!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Little Cub... you mean... Gummy?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah, uhh, yeah!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Noon... Yeah, noon! I saw Little Cub at noon!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"She gave me a really tasty cookie! So I want to give Little Cub an even bigger, even tastier one! But, I don't know how to make a cookie, and I don't know where Little Cub lives either, I-I——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"So I, uhh, I——"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I understand."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan, I——"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You'll twist your tongue in a knot if you keep talking."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Sorry... I-I'm in a bit of a hurry..."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Mm, alright."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Now, listen to me."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Alright..."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I know where she lives."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'll teach you how to make the treat, then bring you there."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Really?!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'm always willing to teach if you're willing to learn."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I want to learn!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I happen to have some fermented dough here. Let's make a huge cookie, okay?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"How big do you want it to be?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"The bigger the better!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Alright."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Help me clear the workspace. I'll get the fire going."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Preparations are just about done."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Did you wash your hands, Kay?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yup!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow, what's this?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Dough."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What should I do?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Simple, just knead the dough."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Just try it and see. I'll let you know if you're doing it wrong."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Kneading the dough..."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Like this?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Yes, continue."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Don't be afraid to crush it, put some force into it."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Knead it for a few more minutes."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Alright, that should be enough. Spread it on the board."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Cut it in half with the knife."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Like this?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Yep."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Then press each half into a circle."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Correct."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"We won't use any stuffing this time. I'll teach you how to prepare the stuffing and how to make pies when you're better at this."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You missed a spot here, yes, here."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Alright, not bad."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Take the dough on the board and put it into the oven.  Use these mitts for safety."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"On the rack in the oven?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Correct."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Okay——It's in!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Making cookies is so easy!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"What else do I need to do?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Watch the time."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ahh——"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"That's hard."},{"x":"Around ten minutes later..."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Kay."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hm... hm?"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"It's time to take the cookie out."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"It's time?!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Yes."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ohhh!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Ah!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Wait!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Put these mitts on first."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"R-Right!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Just place it on the table and it's done."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"O——kay."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"*sniff* *sniff*"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"It smells nice."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"It must be really tasty."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Let me taste it."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ceobe breaks off a piece and chews it)"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"What do you think?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"It's tasty!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Cookies are best when they're still hot."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I have to give this to Little Cub quickly."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'll put it between these wooden boards, so it'll stay warm longer."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'll guide you this time, but you have to go by yourself next time, got it?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it!"},{"x":"Dormitories"},{"x":"Outside Gummy's Place"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"We're here."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ceobe rings the bell)"},{"x":"*Ding Dong*"},{"n":"???","x":"Come in, the door is open!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"(Ceobe pokes her head in)"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Is Little Cub here?"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Hm?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"There you are!"},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Eh?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hiya."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I ate your cookie earlier, so I got you a new one."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan taught me how to make it. It's fresh outta the oven."},{"n":"Gummy","x":"Isn't it... kinda big?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Hurry up and eat it before it gets cold."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Bye bye."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"How did it go?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Little Cub looked very happy."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Oh? That's great."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Vulcan."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Huh?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Thank you!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Heh."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"You don't have to thank me."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Learn to do it well and you can make cookies by yourself next time."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Who knows, you might even be able to make your own honey biscuits one day."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Wow, that sounds good!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Doesn't it?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"But I think I'd still eat your honey biscuits, Vulcan  !"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Really?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yup!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Oh, that sounds good too."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Let's go back. We can't leave the fire alone for too long."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Besides, you haven't finished eating the other cookie yet."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Oh, right!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"I was in such a rush to bring the cookie to Little Cub, I forgot my own."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"That kind of cookie is fine for filling your stomach, but it still lacks a little something to make it really delicious."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"?!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Do you remember the meat sauce from last time?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Mm!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Want to dip your cookie in it?"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yes!"},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"Let's go then."},{"n":"Vulcan","x":"I'm a little hungry too."},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Got it!"},{"n":"Ceobe","x":"Yummy goodies, here I come!"}],"vn":[{"i":0,"bg":"bg_black"},{"i":2,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1]]},{"i":3,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_cerber_1",1]],"f":2},{"i":5,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_cerber_1",1]],"f":1},{"i":6,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_cerber_1",5]],"f":2},{"i":10,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_cerber_1",1]],"f":2},{"i":11,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_cerber_1",1]],"f":1},{"i":12,"bg":"bg_corridor","ch":[["char_163_hpsts_1",1],["char_2013_